        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Chinese Crested Dog, Chien-gris\n- Concepts: hairless dog breeds, dog varieties, extinct breeds\n\nFacts:\n- The Chien-gris, also called Gris de Saint-Louis, was a dog breed that originated in Medieval times and is now extinct.\n- The Chinese Crested Dog is a hairless breed of dog.\n- The Chinese Crested Dog, like most hairless dog breeds, has two varieties born in the same litter: the Powderpuff and the Hairless.",
